return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:25:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T02:25:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'在您自己的 WordPress 网站上销售 Zinn Digital® 主机服务——WordPress、WooCommerce、代理商、分销商、云主机以及 VPS 主机。从您的分销商账户中搜索并提供域名，让您的客户直接登录其主机控制面板，并在 WooCommerce 订单完成付款后自动开通主机。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'托管平台返回了状态 %d。','Find your domain name'=>'查找您的域名','Search'=>'搜索','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'未针对该名称检查任何扩展。','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'此站点目前无法使用域名搜索。','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'我们刚才无法连接到域名注册局。请您稍后重试。','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'API 密钥缺失或已失效。请在 Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit 下进行检查。','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'此 API 密钥不包含域名搜索所需的 sites.view 权限。请在您的分销商控制面板中将其添加到密钥中，或者在此处清除密钥以回退到公共搜索。','Only administrators see this:'=>'仅管理员可见：','We could not check this one — try again'=>'我们无法检查此项 — 请重试','Already registered'=>'已注册','Available — ask us for a price'=>'可用——请向我们咨询价格','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'可用 — 首年 %1$s %2$s','Register it'=>'注册它','Manage my hosting'=>'管理我的主机','Please sign in first.'=>'请先登录。','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'此账户尚未关联到托管服务。','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'托管平台未返回登录链接。','Reseller Toolkit'=>'分销商工具包','Account'=>'账户','Features'=>'功能','Styling'=>'样式','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI 智能体 (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'允许 AI 代理 (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'关闭：以下工具及其 REST 路由完全未注册。','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'您的 Zinn Digital® 分销商账户','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'在您的 Zinn® 控制面板中的“开发者”→“API 密钥”下创建分销商 API 密钥，并将其粘贴在此处。','Reseller API key'=>'分销商 API 密钥','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'仅保留在本站点，绝不会包含在导出或诊断报告中。','Plan to provision'=>'要调配的方案','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'新客户加入的方案代码。留空则每次都会询问您。','API address'=>'API 地址','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'除非 Zinn® 支持团队要求您进行更改，否则请保持原样。','Control-panel address'=>'控制面板地址','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'“我的主机”链接将您的客户导向的页面。','Domain search'=>'域名搜索','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'提供 [zinn_domain_search] 简码','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'将简码放置在任何页面上，以便访问者可以查询域名并通过您进行购买。','Panel link'=>'面板链接','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'向已登录的客户显示“我的托管”链接','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'WooCommerce 配置','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'在 WooCommerce 订单完成时自动配置托管','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'仅对包含您已映射到 Zinn® 方案的产品的订单生效。','Domain search appearance'=>'域名搜索外观','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'此小部件在您自己的主题中呈现。选择预设，或设置您自己的颜色——无论哪种方式，都不会在您的页面中添加任何访客能看出来属于我们的内容。','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'该小部件使用的每个类都已在插件的 readme 中列出，因此开发人员可以覆盖预设未涵盖的任何内容。','Follow my theme'=>'跟随我的主题','Soft'=>'软','High contrast'=>'高对比度','Compact'=>'紧凑','Buy-link colour'=>'购买链接颜色','“Available” colour'=>'“可用”颜色','“Could not check” colour'=>'“无法检查”颜色','Error colour'=>'错误颜色','Corner rounding'=>'圆角','Space inside each row'=>'每行内部间距','Text size'=>'文字大小','Domain-name weight'=>'域名权重','No reseller API key yet.'=>'尚无分销商 API 密钥。','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'域名搜索已可在没有密钥的情况下按公开价格运行。控制面板链接和 WooCommerce 配置需要密钥：请在您的 Zinn® 控制面板中的“开发者 → API 密钥”下创建一个。','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'打开我的 Zinn® 控制盘','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'已设置密钥，但未开启任何内容。','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'这三项功能均未启用，因此此插件在您的网站上未执行任何操作。请在“功能”下开启您所需的内容。','Open Features'=>'打开功能','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'准备就绪 — 已开启 %d 个功能。','Selling from'=>'销售地','Settings'=>'设置','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'尚无 API 密钥，因此未连接任何内容。','Not connected: %s'=>'未连接：%s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'已连接。您的分销商计划是 %s。','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'未配置 Zinn® API 密钥，因此未配置任何资源。','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'此訂單未包含網域名稱，因此沒有需要佈建的項目。','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'托管平台未返回站点。','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'已为 %1$s 配置 Zinn® 主机服务（服务 %2$s）。','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'托管平台未返回客户账户。','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Zinn® 托管未成功配置：%s','Zinn® product line'=>'Zinn® 产品系列','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'购买此产品时要置备的 Zinn® 产品线。留空以使用插件设置中的默认值。','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® 托管','Service id'=>'服务 ID','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'未为此订单配置任何内容。','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已储存。键入新值以替换它。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有与该筛选条件匹配的项目。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'移除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Copied'=>'已复制','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'本站点上的每个 Zinn® 插件，以及它是否正常工作。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件无需任何连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认值','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这将把此插件的每项设置恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断信息','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥 — 您需要在新站点上重新输入这些内容。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'该插件的所有设置均已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出文件。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从其他插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在此导入将保存该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥绝不会包含在导出文件中，因此请重新输入。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有事项需要注意','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'该插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们会协助查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(在新标签页中打开)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'将此发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'将要发送的正是这些内容——没有其他内容，也没有任何隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们将为您创建支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请复制上方内容并自行粘贴到工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从此服务器（%s）连接至 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单——您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 参考编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多份报告。请等待几分钟后再试 — 之前的报告已送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接收报告——这是我们这边的问题，不是您的问题。请稍后重试，或将上述报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告已被拒绝 (HTTP %d)。请复制上方内容并开具工单，注明该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南和服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'用于 WordPress 的 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移，以及专为管理多个网站的用户打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟网站、域名和外链位置，资金安全托管，直至买卖双方均满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的专业人员','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作者、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多种现成服务，或者发布项目让他们竞标。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'起步基准。其下方的任何内容都将覆盖此项。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'保持此选项关闭，将完全按原样使用预设。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供此更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以访问 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务（%s）下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，未被安装。','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'无法完成该操作。请重试，如果仍然失败，请联系网站管理员。','Connect an AI app'=>'连接 AI 应用程序','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'此连接请求已过期。请返回该应用程序并重新开始连接。','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s 正在申请作为 %3$s 在本网站上使用 %2$s。它只能执行您的 WordPress 账户有权执行的操作，并且您可以随时在 AI 代理 (MCP) 设置中将其断开连接。','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s 从 %2$s 识别了自身。','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s 已自动注册。仅当您是从 %2$s 发起此操作时才继续。','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的账户不能在此站点上使用这些工具。请咨询管理员。','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'回答后，您将返回 %s。','Allow %s'=>'允许 %s','Do not allow'=>'不允许','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或格式不正确。请检查该能力的输入架构（input schema）。','The site refused the request.'=>'该站点拒绝了请求。','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'让诸如 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）为您在此站点上工作。它们以 WordPress 用户的身份登录（Claude 和 ChatGPT 通过在此处批准登录，其他助手则使用应用程序密码登录），并且只能执行该用户获准执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 代理需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude 和 ChatGPT：改为登录','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'请将连接地址作为自定义连接器添加到 Claude 中，或在 ChatGPT 开发者模式中作为应用程序添加。它们会打开此网站以便您批准；无需复制密码。','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'已关联到您账户的 AI 应用程序：','Disconnect'=>'断开连接','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'其他 AI 应用程序：应用程序密码','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建应用程序密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'请将此内容添加到您的 AI 应用程序的 MCP 设置中，并附上您的用户名和该密码：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：请将相同的条目放在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下，而不是放在 "mcpServers" 下。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'AI 代理可以在此处使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：能力、REST 和 MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'从本站点管理您在 Zinn Digital® 上的托管客户、其方案及站点。','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'通过您的 Zinn Digital® 分销商账户，管理您的客户、他们的套餐及其网站。','Read your reseller account'=>'读取您的分销商账户','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'单次读取即可返回您的分销商账户信息：品牌、方案、客户和服务的数量，以及已配置的内容。','List your clients'=>'列出您的客户','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'逐页列出您的客户账户（cursor，limit）。','Create a client'=>'创建客户端','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'在您的账户下创建一个客户账户（name；default_currency，三位字母代码）。在他们创建第一个站点之前为其分配方案。','Read a client\'s plan'=>'读取客户的方案','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'返回客户所在的方案及其对您的成本 (client_id)。','Put a client on a plan'=>'为客户分配套餐','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'将客户分配到您的某个方案中 (client_id, plan_code; interval: month 或 year)。请在其第一个站点之前执行此操作。','List the plans you can sell'=>'列出您可以销售的方案','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'列出主机方案及其价格（可通过 product_line 和 currency 缩小范围）。','List your clients\' sites'=>'列出您客户的网站','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'逐页列出您为客户预配的所有内容（client_id 和 status 可缩小范围）。','Create a site for a client'=>'为客户创建站点','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'为您的其中一位客户创建托管站点（client_id、product_line、primary_domain）。费用将按照该客户的方案计入您的账户，如同来自您的商店。','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'暂停客户网站','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'将客户的站点置于未付款暂停状态（site_id；原因：您自己的备注，绝不会向客户显示）。该站点将停止提供服务，直到解除暂停。','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'取消暂停客户的网站','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'解除未付款冻结，以便站点恢复正常访问 (site_id)。','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'读取分销商工具包设置','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'返回此插件的设置（API 地址、新订单使用的方案、启用了哪些功能）。API 密钥绝不会被返回，仅返回是否已保存。','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'更改 Reseller Toolkit 设置','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'更改您发送的设置（plan_code、enable_domain_search、enable_panel_link、enable_woocommerce）并保留其余设置。API 密钥和地址仅在屏幕上更改。','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'请先在 Reseller Toolkit 屏幕上添加您的 Zinn Digital® 分销商 API 密钥。']];